---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /india/blog/
title: "India Personal Finance Blog — 52 Guides | CalcPhi"
description: "In-depth guides on income tax, SIP returns, NPS, FD, term insurance, home loans, and retirement planning for India. Real numbers, current rules, no jargon — written by CFAs, CAs, and CFPs."
breadcrumbs:
  - name: Home
    url: /
  - name: India
    url: /india/
  - name: Blog
---

<main id="main-content">
  <div class="hub-hero">
    <div class="hub-hero__inner">
      <h1>India Personal Finance Blog</h1>
      <p>52 guides covering income tax, mutual funds, FD, NPS, term insurance, home loans, and retirement planning. Real numbers, current regulations, written by CFAs, CAs, and CFPs.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hub-content">

    <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem;">
      <span style="display:inline-block;padding:0.3rem 0.85rem;border-radius:2rem;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:600;background:var(--color-muted);border:1px solid var(--color-border);color:var(--color-text-secondary);">Tax &mdash; 11</span>
      <span style="display:inline-block;padding:0.3rem 0.85rem;border-radius:2rem;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:600;background:var(--color-muted);border:1px solid var(--color-border);color:var(--color-text-secondary);">Investing &mdash; 11</span>
      <span style="display:inline-block;padding:0.3rem 0.85rem;border-radius:2rem;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:600;background:var(--color-muted);border:1px solid var(--color-border);color:var(--color-text-secondary);">Savings &mdash; 8</span>
      <span style="display:inline-block;padding:0.3rem 0.85rem;border-radius:2rem;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:600;background:var(--color-muted);border:1px solid var(--color-border);color:var(--color-text-secondary);">Retirement &mdash; 7</span>
      <span style="display:inline-block;padding:0.3rem 0.85rem;border-radius:2rem;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:600;background:var(--color-muted);border:1px solid var(--color-border);color:var(--color-text-secondary);">Real Estate &mdash; 5</span>
      <span style="display:inline-block;padding:0.3rem 0.85rem;border-radius:2rem;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:600;background:var(--color-muted);border:1px solid var(--color-border);color:var(--color-text-secondary);">Salary &mdash; 5</span>
      <span style="display:inline-block;padding:0.3rem 0.85rem;border-radius:2rem;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:600;background:var(--color-muted);border:1px solid var(--color-border);color:var(--color-text-secondary);">Loans &mdash; 4</span>
      <span style="display:inline-block;padding:0.3rem 0.85rem;border-radius:2rem;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:600;background:var(--color-muted);border:1px solid var(--color-border);color:var(--color-text-secondary);">Insurance &mdash; 1</span>
    </div>

    <div class="blog-grid">

      {% for post in collections.indiaBlog %}
        {% set slug = post.url | replace("/india/blog/", "") | replace("/", "") %}
        {% set meta = india.blogMeta[slug] %}
        {% if meta %}
        <article class="blog-card">
          <div class="blog-card__meta">
            <span class="blog-card__tag">{{ meta.category }}</span>
            <span class="blog-card__date">{{ post.data.datePublished | monthYear }}</span>
            {% if post.data.dateModified and post.data.dateModified != post.data.datePublished %}
            <span class="blog-card__updated">Updated {{ post.data.dateModified | monthYear }}</span>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ meta.cardTitle }}</a></h2>
          <p>{{ meta.cardSummary }}</p>
          <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="blog-card__read">Read article →</a>
        </article>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}

    </div>
  </div>
</main>
